      "content": "What you're saying sounds incredibly overwhelming, and it seems like you're going through an incredibly difficult time. It's okay to feel this way, and it sounds like you've been carrying a heavy burden for a long time. When things feel so overwhelming, it's understandable to feel like everything is just too much to bear. Reaching out to a mental health professional might offer some relief. They can provide a safe space for you to express these feelings and help you work through them at your own pace. Remember that it's okay to take small steps and give yourself permission to rest and seek help. You're not alone.",
      "source": "target",
